{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Which parts of Bengaluru do you serve?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"All of Bengaluru. We come to every PIN code from 560001 to 560110, including HSR Layout, Koramangala, Indiranagar, Whitefield, Jayanagar, JP Nagar, Hebbal and Electronic City. Type your PIN code on the home page to check it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you service bikes at home in Bengaluru?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. A Mechanix Pro-certified mechanic comes to your home, office or roadside in our service areas. If a job needs workshop tools, we pick up the bike with your OTP consent and bring it back."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does a bike service cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Basic service is {{text:basic}}, Standard service {{text:general}} and Full service {{text:full}} for bikes and scooters up to 149cc, excluding GST; 150 to 250cc and 251 to 500cc bikes have their own prices on the services page. 18% GST is added on your bill. Your exact quote comes on WhatsApp before any work starts."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get a quote and confirm my booking?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Build your service on the website and send it to us on WhatsApp. Our expert calls or messages you, confirms what is needed and sends your quote. Once you approve, we confirm your slot and send a secure link to pay {{feetext:advance}}, which is adjusted in your final bill."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a warranty?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our service work is covered for {{days}} days from the service date. Parts carry a limited warranty on the terms of the part's manufacturer or supplier, shown on your invoice."}}]}